#: kio/kio/global.cpp:395 kio/kio/global.cpp:477
msgid "(unknown)"
msgstr "(nepoznato)"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:407
msgid "<b>Technical Reason</b>: "
msgstr "<b>Tehnički razlozi</b>: "

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:408
msgid "</p><p><b>Details of the Request</b>:"
msgstr "</p><p><b>Detalji zahtjeva</b>:"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:409
msgid "</p><ul><li>URL: %1</li>"
msgstr "</p><ul><li>URL: %1</li>"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:411
msgid "<li>Protocol: %1</li>"
msgstr "<li>Protokol: %1</li>"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:413
msgid "<li>Date and Time: %1</li>"
msgstr "<li>Datum i vrijeme: %1</li>"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:414
msgid "<li>Additional Information: %1</li></ul>"
msgstr "<li>Dodatne informacije: %1</li></ul>"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:416
msgid "<p><b>Possible Causes</b>:</p><ul><li>"
msgstr "<p><b>Mogući uzroci</b>:</p><ul><li>"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:421
msgid "<p><b>Possible Solutions</b>:</p><ul><li>"
msgstr "<p><b>Moguća rješenja</b>:</p><ul><li>"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:487
msgid ""
"Contact your appropriate computer support system, whether the system "
"administrator, or technical support group for further assistance."
msgstr ""
"Kontaktirajte vaš odgovarajući sistem za podršku, bio to sistem "
"administrator ili grupa za tehničku podršku, radi dalje pomoći."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:490
msgid "Contact the administrator of the server for further assistance."
msgstr "Kontaktirajte administratora servera radi dalje pomoći"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:493
msgid "Check your access permissions on this resource."
msgstr "Provjerite vaše pristupne privilegije na ovaj resurs."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:494
msgid ""
"Your access permissions may be inadequate to perform the requested operation "
"on this resource."
msgstr ""
"Vaše pristupne privilegije možda nisu dovoljne da bi se obavila tražena "
"operacija na ovom resursu."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:496
msgid "The file may be in use (and thus locked) by another user or application."
msgstr ""
"Datoteka je možda već u upotrebi (zaključana) od strane drugog korisnika "
"ili aplikacije."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:498
msgid ""
"Check to make sure that no other application or user is using the file or "
"has locked the file."
msgstr ""
"Provjerite da li neka druga aplikacija ili korisnik koristi datoteku ili je "
"zaključao datoteku."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:500
msgid "Although unlikely, a hardware error may have occurred."
msgstr "Iako je to malo vjerovatno, možda je došlo do hardverske greške."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:502
msgid "You may have encountered a bug in the program."
msgstr "Možda ste otkrili bug u programu."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:503
msgid ""
"This is most likely to be caused by a bug in the program. Please consider "
"submitting a full bug report as detailed below."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je najvjerovatnije izazvano bugom u programu. Molim razmotrite slanje "
"puno izvještaja o bugu kako je objašnjeno ispod."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:505
msgid ""
"Update your software to the latest version. Your distribution should provide "
"tools to update your software."
msgstr ""
"Updatujte vaš softver na najnoviju verziju. Vaša distribucija bi trebala "
"osigurati alate za update vašeg softvera."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:507
msgid ""
"When all else fails, please consider helping the KDE team or the third party "
"maintainer of this software by submitting a high quality bug report. If the "
"software is provided by a third party, please contact them directly. "
"Otherwise, first look to see if the same bug has been submitted by someone "
"else by searching at the <a href=\"http://bugs.kde.org/\">KDE bug reporting "
"website</a>. If not, take note of the details given above, and include them "
"in your bug report, along with as many other details as you think might help."
msgstr ""
"Kada ništa drugo ne uspije, razmislite o tome da pomognete KDE teamu ili "
"nekom drugom održavatelju programa šaljući kvalitetan izvještaj o bugu. "
"Ako softver osigurava neko treće lice, kontaktirajte direktno njih. U "
"suprotnom, najprije pogledajte da li je isti bug već prijavio neko drugi "
"tako što ćete pretražiti <a href=\"http://bugs.kde.org/\">KDE web "
"stranicu za prijavu bugova</a>. Ako ne, upamtite detalje navedene gore i "
"uključite ih u vaš izvještaj, zajedno sa što je moguće više drugih "
"detalja za koje mislite da mogu biti od pomoći."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:515
msgid "There may have been a problem with your network connection."
msgstr "Možda imate problema sa vašom mrežnom konekcijom."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:518
msgid ""
"There may have been a problem with your network configuration. If you have "
"been accessing the Internet with no problems recently, this is unlikely."
msgstr ""
"Možda imate problema sa postavkama mreže. Ako ste nedavno pristupali "
"Internetu bez ikakvih problema, ovo vjerovatno nije slučaj."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:521
msgid ""
"There may have been a problem at some point along the network path between "
"the server and this computer."
msgstr ""
"Možda postoji problem na nekoj tački duž mrežnog puta između servera i "
"ovog računara."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:523
msgid "Try again, either now or at a later time."
msgstr "Pokušajte ponovo, sada ili kasnije."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:524
msgid "A protocol error or incompatability may have occurred."
msgstr "Možda je došlo do greške ili nekompatibilnosti u protokolu."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:525
msgid "Ensure that the resource exists, and try again."
msgstr "Provjerite da li resurs postoji i probajte ponovo."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:526
msgid "The specified resource may not exist."
msgstr "Navedeni resurs možda ne postoji."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:527
msgid "You may have incorrectly typed the location."
msgstr "Možda niste ispravno unijeli lokaciju."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:528
msgid "Double-check that you have entered the correct location and try again."
msgstr "Provjerite dva puta da li ste ispravno unijeli lokaciju i pokušajte ponovo."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:530
msgid "Check your network connection status."
msgstr "Provjerite status vaše mrežne konekcije."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:534
msgid "Cannot Open Resource For Reading"
msgstr "Ne mogu otvoriti resurs za čitanje"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:535
msgid ""
"This means that the contents of the requested file or directory "
"<strong>%1</strong> could not be retrieved, as read access could not be "
"obtained."
msgstr ""
"Ovo znači da sadržaj tražene datoteke ili direktorija <strong>%1</strong>"
" nije mogao biti dobavljen, pošto nisam mogao osigurati pristup za čitanje."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:538
msgid "You may not have permissions to read the file or open the directory."
msgstr "Nemate ovlast za čitanje datoteke ili otvaranje direktorija."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:544
msgid "Cannot Open Resource For Writing"
msgstr "Ne mogu otvoriti resurs za čitanje"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:545
msgid ""
"This means that the file, <strong>%1</strong>, could not be written to as "
"requested, because access with permission to write could not be obtained."
msgstr ""
"Ovo znači da datoteka, <strong>%1</strong>, nije mogla biti zapisana kako "
"je traženo, pošto nisam mogao dobiti dozvolu za pisanje."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:553
msgid "Cannot Initiate the %1 Protocol"
msgstr "Ne mogu pokrenuti protokol %1"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:554
msgid "Unable to Launch Process"
msgstr "Ne mogu pokrenuti proces"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:555
msgid ""
"The program on your computer which provides access to the "
"<strong>%1</strong> protocol could not be started. This is usually due to "
"technical reasons."
msgstr ""
"Nisam mogao pokrenuti program na vašem računaru koji omogućuje pristup "
"protokolu <strong>%1</strong>. Ovo je obično iz tehničkih razloga."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:558
msgid ""
"The program which provides compatability with this protocol may not have "
"been updated with your last update of KDE. This can cause the program to be "
"incompatible with the current version and thus not start."
msgstr ""
"Program koji pruža kompatibilnost za ovaj protokol možda nije updatovan "
"kada ste zadnji put updatovali KDE. Ovo može izazvati da program bude "
"nekompatibilan sa trenutnom verzijom i stoga neće da se pokrene."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:566
msgid "Internal Error"
msgstr "Interna greška"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:567
msgid ""
"The program on your computer which provides access to the "
"<strong>%1</strong> protocol has reported an internal error."
msgstr ""
"Program na vašem računaru koji omogućuje pristup protokolu "
"<strong>%1</strong> je prijavio internu grešku."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:575
msgid "Inproperly Formatted URL"
msgstr "Neispravno formatiran URL"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:576
msgid ""
"The <strong>U</strong>niversal <strong>R</strong>esource "
"<strong>L</strong>"
"ocation (URL) that you entered was not properly formatted. The format of a "
"URL is generally as "
"follows:"
"<blockquote><strong>"
"protocol://user@password:www.example.org:port/directory/filename.extension?qu"
"ery=value</strong></blockquote>"
msgstr ""
"<strong>U</strong>niversal <strong>R</strong>esource "
"<strong>L</strong>ocation (univerzalna lokacija resursa - URL) koji ste "
"unijeli nije ispravno formatiran. Format URLa je obično "
"ovakav:"
"<blockquote><strong>"
"protokol://korisnik@šifra:www.primjer.ba:port/direktorij/datoteka.ekstenzija"
"?upit=vrijednost</strong></blockquote>"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:585
#, c-format
msgid "Unsupported Protocol %1"
msgstr "Protokol %1 nije podržan"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:586
msgid ""
"The protocol <strong>%1</strong> is not supported by the KDE programs "
"currently installed on this computer."
msgstr ""
"KDE programi trenutno instalirani na ovom računaru ne podržavaju protocol "
"<strong>%1</strong>."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:589
msgid "The requested protocol may not be supported."
msgstr "Traženi protokol možda nije podržan."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:590
msgid ""
"The versions of the %1 protocol supported by this computer and the server "
"may be incompatible."
msgstr ""
"Verzije protokola %1 koje podržavaju ovaj računar i server možda nisu "
"suglasne."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:592
msgid ""
"You may perform a search on the Internet for a KDE program (called a "
"kioslave or ioslave) which supports this protocol. Places to search include "
"<a href=\"http://apps.kde.com/\">http://apps.kde.com/</a> and <a "
"href=\"http://freshmeat.net/\">http://freshmeat.net/</a>."
msgstr ""
"Možete pretražiti Internet za KDE program (koji se zove kioslave ili "
"ioslave) koji podržava ovaj protokol. Mjesta na kojima možete tražiti "
"uključuju <a href=\"http://apps.kde.com/\">http://apps.kde.com/</a> i <a "
"href=\"http://freshmeat.net/\">http://freshmeat.net/</a>."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:601
msgid "URL Does Not Refer to a Resource."
msgstr "URL ne pokazuje na resurs."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:602
msgid "Protocol is a Filter Protocol"
msgstr "Protokol je filter protokol"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:603
msgid ""
"The <strong>U</strong>niversal <strong>R</strong>esource "
"<strong>L</strong>"
"ocation (URL) that you entered did not refer to a specific resource."
msgstr ""
"<strong>U</strong>niversal <strong>R</strong>esource "
"<strong>L</strong>ocation (univerzalna lokacija resursa - URL) koji ste "
"unijeli se ne odnosi na neki određen resurs."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:606
msgid ""
"KDE is able to communicate through a protocol within a protocol; the "
"protocol specified is only for use in such situations, however this is not "
"one of these situations. This is a rare event, and is likely to indicate a "
"programming error."
msgstr ""
"KDE može komunicirati kroz protokol unutar protokola, navedeni protokol se "
"koristi samo u takvim situacijama, a ovo nije jedna od tih situacija. Ovo je "
"vrlo rijedak slučaj i vjerovatno ukazuje na grešku u programiranju."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:614
#, c-format
msgid "Unsupported Action: %1"
msgstr "Akcija %1 nije podržana"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:615
msgid ""
"The requested action is not supported by the KDE program which is "
"implementing the <strong>%1</strong> protocol."
msgstr ""
"KDE program koji implementira protokol <strong>%1</strong> ne podržava "
"traženu akciju."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:618
msgid ""
"This error is very much dependant on the KDE program. The additional "
"information should give you more information than is available to the KDE "
"input / output architecture."
msgstr ""
"Ova greška znatno ovisi o KDE programu. Dodatne informacije bi "
"predstavljale više informacija nego što je dostupno KDEovoj "
"ulazno-izlaznoj arhitekturi."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:621
msgid "Attempt to find another way to accomplish the same outcome."
msgstr "Pokušavam naći drugi način da ostvarim isti rezultat."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:626
msgid "File Expected"
msgstr "Datoteka je očekivana"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:627
msgid ""
"The request expected a file, however the directory <strong>%1</strong> was "
"found instead."
msgstr ""
"Zahtjev je očekivao datoteku, a umjesto toga je pronašao direktorij "
"<strong>%1</strong>."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:629
msgid "This may be an error on the server side."
msgstr "Ovo je možda greška na strani servera."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:634
msgid "Directory Expected"
msgstr "Direktorij je očekivan"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:635
msgid ""
"The request expected a directory, however the file <strong>%1</strong> was "
"found instead."
msgstr ""
"Zahtjev je očekivao direktorij, a umjesto toga je pronašao datoteku "
"<strong>%1</strong>."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:642
msgid "File or Directory Does Not Exist"
msgstr "Navedena datoteka ili direktorij ne postoji"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:643
msgid "The specified file or directory <strong>%1</strong> does not exist."
msgstr "Navedena datoteka ili direktorij <strong>%1</strong> ne postoji."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:650
msgid "File Already Exists"
msgstr "Datoteka već postoji"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:651
msgid ""
"The requested file could not be created because a file with the same name "
"already exists."
msgstr ""
"Tražena datoteka nije mogla biti napravljena pošto datoteka pod istim "
"imenom već postoji."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:653
msgid "Try moving the current file out of the way first, and then try again."
msgstr "Pokušajte skloniti postojeću datoteku i pokušati ponovo."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:655
msgid "Delete the current file and try again."
msgstr "Obrišite trenutnu datoteku i pokušajte ponovo."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:656
msgid "Choose an alternate filename for the new file."
msgstr "Izaberite neku drugo ime za novu datoteku."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:660
msgid "Directory Already Exists"
msgstr "Direktorij već postoji"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:661
msgid ""
"The requested directory could not be created because a directory with the "
"same name already exists."
msgstr ""
"Traženi direktorij nije mogao biti napravljen pošto direktorij pod istim "
"imenom već postoji."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:663
msgid "Try moving the current directory out of the way first, and then try again."
msgstr "Pokušajte skloniti postojeći direktorij i pokušati ponovo."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:665
msgid "Delete the current directory and try again."
msgstr "Obrišite trenutni direktorij i pokušajte ponovo."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:666
msgid "Choose an alternate name for the new directory."
msgstr "Izaberite neku drugo ime za novi direktorij."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:670
msgid "Unknown Host"
msgstr "Nepoznat računar"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:671
msgid ""
"An unknown host error indicates that the server with the requested name, "
"<strong>%1</strong>, could not be located on the Internet."
msgstr ""
"Greška 'Nepoznat računar' ukazuje da server pod traženim imenom, "
"<strong>%1</strong>, nije lociran na Interntu."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:674
msgid "The name that you typed, %1, may not exist: it may be incorrectly typed."
msgstr ""
"Ime koje ste unijeli, %1, možda ne postoji: možda ga niste ispravno "
"otkucali."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:681
msgid "Access Denied"
msgstr "Pristup odbijen"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:682
msgid "Access was denied to the specified resource, <strong>%1</strong>."
msgstr "Pristup navedenom resursu, <strong>%1</strong>, je odbijen."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:684 kio/kio/global.cpp:900
msgid "You may have supplied incorrect authentication details or none at all."
msgstr ""
"Možda ste naveli pogrešne detalje za autentikaciju ili ih uopšte niste "
"naveli."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:686 kio/kio/global.cpp:902
msgid "Your account may not have permission to access the specified resource."
msgstr "Vaš račun možda nema ovlast za pristup navedenom resursu."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:688 kio/kio/global.cpp:904 kio/kio/global.cpp:916
msgid ""
"Retry the request and ensure your authentication details are entered "
"correctly."
msgstr ""
"Ponovite zahtjev i osigurajte da su vaši detalji za autentikaciju ispravno "
"uneseni."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:694
msgid "Write Access Denied"
msgstr "Odbijen pristup za pisanje"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:695
msgid ""
"This means that an attempt to write to the file <strong>%1</strong> was "
"rejected."
msgstr "Ovo znači da je pokušaj pisanja u datoteku <strong>%1</strong> odbijen."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:702
msgid "Unable to Enter Directory"
msgstr "Ne mogu ući u direktorij."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:703
msgid ""
"This means that an attempt to enter (in other words, to open) the requested "
"directory <strong>%1</strong> was rejected."
msgstr ""
"Ovo znači da je pokušaj ulaska (ili drugim riječima, otvaranja) traženog "
"direktorija <strong>%1</strong> odbijen."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:711
msgid "Directory Listing Unavailable"
msgstr "Listing direktorija nije dostupan"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:712
msgid "Protocol %1 is not a Filesystem"
msgstr "Protokol %1 nije datotečni sistem"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:713
msgid ""
"This means that a request was made which requires determining the contents "
"of the directory, and the KDE program supporting this protocol is unable to "
"do so."
msgstr ""
"Ovo znači da je napravljen zahtjev koji traži određivanje sadržaja "
"direktorija, a KDE program koji podržava ovaj protokol nije u stanju to da "
"uradi."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:721
msgid "Cyclic Link Detected"
msgstr "Otkriven kružni link"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:722
msgid ""
"Unix environments are commonly able to link a file or directory to a "
"separate name and/or location. KDE detected a link or series of links that "
"results in an infinite loop - i.e., the file was (perhaps in a roundabout "
"way) linked to itself."
msgstr ""
"Unix okoline često mogu linkovati datoteku ili direktorij na odvojeno ime "
"i/ili lokaciju. KDE je otkrio link ili niz linkova koji rezultiraju "
"beskonačnom petljom - drugim riječima, datoteka je (vjerovatno na "
"zaobilazan način) linkovana na samu sebe."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:726 kio/kio/global.cpp:748
msgid ""
"Delete one part of the loop in order that it does not cause an infinite "
"loop, and try again."
msgstr ""
"Obrišite jedan dio petlje na takav način da ona ne izaziva beskonačnu "
"petlju i pokušajte ponovo."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:735
msgid "Request Aborted By User"
msgstr "Zahtjev prekinut od strane korisnika"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:736 kio/kio/global.cpp:1029
msgid "The request was not completed because it was aborted."
msgstr "Zahtjev nije završen zato što je prekinut."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:738 kio/kio/global.cpp:932 kio/kio/global.cpp:1031
msgid "Retry the request."
msgstr "Ponovite zahtjev."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:742
msgid "Cyclic Link Detected During Copy"
msgstr "Kružni link otkriven prilikom kopiranja."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:743
msgid ""
"Unix environments are commonly able to link a file or directory to a "
"separate name and/or location. During the requested copy operation, KDE "
"detected a link or series of links that results in an infinite loop - i.e., "
"the file was (perhaps in a roundabout way) linked to itself."
msgstr ""
"Unix okoline često mogu linkovati datoteku ili direktorij na odvojeno ime "
"i/ili lokaciju. Tokom tražene operacije kopiranja, KDE je otkrio link ili "
"niz linkova koji rezultiraju beskonačnom petljom - drugim riječima, "
"datoteka je (vjerovatno na zaobilazan način) linkovana na samu sebe."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:753
msgid "Could Not Create Network Connection"
msgstr "Ne mogu napraviti mrežnu konekciju"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:754
msgid "Could Not Create Socket"
msgstr "Ne mogu napraviti socket"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:755
msgid ""
"This is a fairly technical error in which a required device for network "
"communications (a socket) could not be created."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je prilično tehnička greška u kojoj traženo sredstvo za mrežne "
"komunikacije (socket) nije mogao biti napravljen."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:757 kio/kio/global.cpp:870 kio/kio/global.cpp:881
#: kio/kio/global.cpp:890
msgid ""
"The network connection may be incorrectly configured, or the network "
"interface may not be enabled."
msgstr ""
"Mrežna konekcija možda nije dobro podešena ili nije uključen mrežni "
"interfejs."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:763
msgid "Connection to Server Refused"
msgstr "Veza na server odbijena"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:764
msgid ""
"The server <strong>%1</strong> refused to allow this computer to make a "
"connection."
msgstr "Server <strong>%1</strong> je odbio dozvoliti ovom računaru da napravi vezu."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:766
msgid ""
"The server, while currently connected to the Internet, may not be configured "
"to allow requests."
msgstr ""
"Iako je server trenutno spojen na Internet, možda nije podešen da dozvoli "
"zahtjeve."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:768
msgid ""
"The server, while currently connected to the Internet, may not be running "
"the requested service (%1)."
msgstr ""
"Iako je server trenutno spojen na Internet, možda traženi servis (%1) nije "
"pokrenut na njemu."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:770
msgid ""
"A network firewall (a device which restricts Internet requests), either "
"protecting your network or the network of the server, may have intervened, "
"preventing this request."
msgstr ""
"Možda se mrežni firewall (uređaj koji ograničava Internet zahtjeve) koji "
"štiti vašu mrežu ili mrežu servera, umješao, sprječavajući ovaj "
"zahtjev."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:777
msgid "Connection to Server Closed Unexpectedly"
msgstr "Veza na server je neočekivano prekinuta"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:778
msgid ""
"Although a connection was established to <strong>%1</strong>"
", the connection was closed at an unexpected point in the communication."
msgstr ""
"Iako je uspostavljena veza na <strong>%1</strong>, ona je zatvorena na "
"neočekivanoj tačci komunikacije."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:781
msgid ""
"A protocol error may have occurred, causing the server to close the "
"connection as a response to the error."
msgstr ""
"Možda je došlo do greške u protokolu, koja je izazvala da server zatvori "
"vezu kao odgovor na grešku."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:787
msgid "URL Resource Invalid."
msgstr "Neispravan URL resurs"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:788
msgid "Protocol %1 is not a Filter Protocol"
msgstr "Protokol %1 nije filter protokol"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:789
msgid ""
"The <strong>U</strong>niversal <strong>R</strong>esource "
"<strong>L</strong>ocation (URL) that you entered did not refer to a valid "
"mechanism of accessing the specific resource, <strong>%1%2</strong>."
msgstr ""
"<strong>U</strong>niversal <strong>R</strong>esource "
"<strong>L</strong>ocation (univerzalna lokacija resursa - URL) koji ste "
"unijeli nije definisao ispravan mehanizam za pristup određenom resursu, "
"<strong>%1%2</strong>."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:794
msgid ""
"KDE is able to communicate through a protocol within a protocol. This "
"request specified a protocol be used as such, however this protocol is not "
"capable of such an action. This is a rare event, and is likely to indicate a "
"programming error."
msgstr ""
"KDE može komunicirati kroz protokol unutar protokola. Ovaj zahtjev je "
"tražio takav protokol, ali navedeni protokol nije u stanju izvršiti takvu "
"akciju. Ovo je vrlo rijedak slučaj i vjerovatno ukazuje na grešku u "
"programiranju."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:802
msgid "Unable to Initialize Input/Output Device"
msgstr "Ne mogu inicijalizirati ulazno-izlazni uređaj"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:803
msgid "Could Not Mount Device"
msgstr "Ne mogu montirati uređaj"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:804
msgid ""
"The requested device could not be initialized (\"mounted\"). The reported "
"error was: <strong>%1</strong>"
msgstr ""
"Traženi uređaj nije mogao biti inicijaliziran (\"montiran\"). Greška koja "
"je prijavljena glasi: <strong>%1</strong>"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:807
msgid ""
"The device may not be ready, for example there may be no media in a "
"removable media device (i.e. no CD-ROM in a CD drive), or in the case of a "
"peripheral / portable device, the device may not be correctly connected."
msgstr ""
"Uređaj možda nije spreman, na primjer nema medija u uređaju sa "
"promjenjivim medijem (npr. nema CDa u CD-ROM uređaju), ili u slučaju "
"periferijskog / prenosivog uređaja, možda uređaj nije ispravno spojen."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:811
msgid ""
"You may not have permissions to initialize (\"mount\") the device. On UNIX "
"systems, often system administrator privileges are required to initialize a "
"device."
msgstr ""
"Možda nemate dozvolu da inicijalizirate (\"montirate\") uređaj. Na UNIX "
"sistemima, često su potrebne administratorske privilegije za "
"inicijaliziranje uređaja."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:815
msgid ""
"Check that the device is ready; removable drives must contain media, and "
"portable devices must be connected and powered on.; and try again."
msgstr ""
"Provjerite da li je uređaj spreman; uređaji sa promjenjivim medijem moraju "
"sadržavati medij, a prenosivi uređaju moraju biti spojeni i upaljeni; onda "
"pokušajte ponovo."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:821
msgid "Unable to Uninitialize Input/Output Device"
msgstr "Ne mogu deinicijalizirati ulazno-izlazni uređaj"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:822
msgid "Could Not Unmount Device"
msgstr "Ne mogu demontirati uređaj"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:823
msgid ""
"The requested device could not be uninitialized (\"unmounted\"). The "
"reported error was: <strong>%1</strong>"
msgstr ""
"Traženi uređaj nije mogao biti deinicijaliziran (\"demontiran\"). Greška "
"koja je prijavljena glasi: <strong>%1</strong>"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:826
msgid ""
"The device may be busy, that is, still in use by another application or "
"user. Even such things as having an open browser window on a location on "
"this device may cause the device to remain in use."
msgstr ""
"Uređaj je možda zauzet, tj. još uvijek u upotrebi od strane neke druge "
"aplikacije ili korisnika. Čak i stvari kao što je otvoren prozor "
"preglednika na nekoj lokaciji na ovom uređaju mogu izazvati da uređaj "
"ostane u upotrebi."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:830
msgid ""
"You may not have permissions to uninitialize (\"unmount\") the device. On "
"UNIX systems, system administrator privileges are often required to "
"uninitialize a device."
msgstr ""
"Možda nemate dozvolu da deinicijalizirate (\"demontirate\") uređaj. Na "
"UNIX sistemima, često su potrebne administratorske privilegije za "
"deinicijaliziranje uređaja."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:834
msgid "Check that no applications are accessing the device, and try again."
msgstr "Provjerite da nijedna aplikacija ne pristupa uređaju i probajte ponovo."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:839
msgid "Cannot Read From Resource"
msgstr "Ne mogu čitati sa resursa"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:840
msgid ""
"This means that although the resource, <strong>%1</strong>, was able to be "
"opened, an error occurred while reading the contents of the resource."
msgstr ""
"Ovo znači da iako se resurs, <strong>%1</strong>"
", mogao otvoriti, došlo je do greške prilikom čitanja sadržaja resursa."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:843
msgid "You may not have permissions to read from the resource."
msgstr "Možda nemate ovlasti za čitanje sa resursa."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:852
msgid "Cannot Write to Resource"
msgstr "Ne mogu pisati u resurs"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:853
msgid ""
"This means that although the resource, <strong>%1</strong>, was able to be "
"opened, an error occurred while writing to the resource."
msgstr ""
"Ovo znači da iako se resurs, <strong>%1</strong>"
", mogao otvoriti, došlo je do greške prilikom pisanja u resurs."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:856
msgid "You may not have permissions to write to the resource."
msgstr "Možda nemate ovlasti za pisanje u resurs."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:865 kio/kio/global.cpp:876
msgid "Could Not Listen for Network Connections"
msgstr "Ne mogu slušati mrežne konekcije"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:866
msgid "Could Not Bind"
msgstr "Ne mogu se vezati"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:867 kio/kio/global.cpp:878
msgid ""
"This is a fairly technical error in which a required device for network "
"communications (a socket) could not be established to listen for incoming "
"network connections."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je prilično tehnička greška u kojoj traženo sredstvo za mrežne "
"komunikacije (socket) nije mogao biti napravljen tako da sluša tj. očekuje "
"dolazne mrežne konekcije."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:877
msgid "Could Not Listen"
msgstr "Ne mogu slušati"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:887
msgid "Could Not Accept Network Connection"
msgstr "Ne mogu primati mrežne konekcije"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:888
msgid ""
"This is a fairly technical error in which an error occurred while attempting "
"to accept an incoming network connection."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je prilično tehnička greška u kojoj je došlo do greške prilikom "
"pokušaja primanja dolazne mrežne konekcije."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:892
msgid "You may not have permissions to accept the connection."
msgstr "Možda nemate ovlasti da prihvatite konekciju."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:897
#, c-format
msgid "Could Not Login: %1"
msgstr "Ne mogu se prijaviti: %1"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:898
msgid "An attempt to login to perform the requested operation was unsuccessful."
msgstr ""
"Pokušaj prijavljivanja (login) kako bi se izvršila tražena operacija nije "
"bio uspješan."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:909
msgid "Could Not Determine Resource Status"
msgstr "Ne mogu odrediti status resursa"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:910
msgid "Could Not Stat Resource"
msgstr "Ne mogu stat-ovati resurs"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:911
msgid ""
"An attempt to determine information about the status of the resource "
"<strong>%1</strong>, such as the resource name, type, size, etc., was "
"unsuccessful."
msgstr ""
"Pokušaj da se odrede informacije o statusu resursa <strong>%1</strong>"
", kao što je naziv resursa, tip, veličina itd nije bio uspješan."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:914
msgid "The specified resource may not have existed or may not be accessible."
msgstr "Traženi resurs možda ne postoji ili nije pristupačan."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:922
msgid "Could Not Cancel Listing"
msgstr "Ne mogu prekinuti slušanje"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:923
msgid "FIXME: Document this"
msgstr "FIXME: Document this"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:927
msgid "Could Not Create Directory"
msgstr "Ne mogu napraviti direktorij"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:928
msgid "An attempt to create the requested directory failed."
msgstr "Pokušaj pravljenja traženog direktorija nije uspio."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:929
msgid "The location where the directory was to be created may not exist."
msgstr "Lokacija gdje je trebalo napraviti direktorij možda ne postoji."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:936
msgid "Could Not Remove Directory"
msgstr "Ne mogu ukloniti direktorij"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:937
msgid "An attempt to remove the specified directory, <strong>%1</strong>, failed."
msgstr "Pokušaj uklanjanja traženog direktorija, <strong>%1</strong>, nije uspio."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:939
msgid "The specified directory may not exist."
msgstr "Traženi direktorij možda ne postoji."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:940
msgid "The specified directory may not be empty."
msgstr "Traženi direktorij možda nije prazan."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:943
msgid "Ensure that the directory exists and is empty, and try again."
msgstr "Provjerite da li direktorij postoji i da li je prazan i pokušajte ponovo."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:948
msgid "Could Not Resume File Transfer"
msgstr "Ne mogu nastaviti transfer datoteke"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:949
msgid ""
"The specified request asked that the transfer of file <strong>%1</strong>"
" be resumed at a certain point of the transfer. This was not possible."
msgstr ""
"U navedenom zahtjevu tražili ste da se transfer datoteke "
"<strong>%1</strong> nastavi na određenoj tački transfera. Ovo nije bilo "
"moguće."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:952
msgid "The protocol, or the server, may not support file resuming."
msgstr "Protokol ili server ne podržavaju nastavljanje prenosa datoteka."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:954
msgid "Retry the request without attempting to resume transfer."
msgstr "Ponovite zahtjev ali bez pokušaja nastavljanja prenosa."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:959
msgid "Could Not Rename Resource"
msgstr "Ne mogu promijeniti ime resursa"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:960
msgid "An attempt to rename the specified resource <strong>%1</strong> failed."
msgstr "Pokušaj promjene imena resursa <strong>%1</strong> nije uspio."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:968
msgid "Could Not Alter Permissions of Resource"
msgstr "Ne mogu promjeniti dozvole resursa"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:969
msgid ""
"An attempt to alter the permissions on the specified resource "
"<strong>%1</strong> failed."
msgstr "Pokušaj izmjene dozvola na traženom resursu <strong>%1</strong> nije uspio."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:976
msgid "Could Not Delete Resource"
msgstr "Ne mogu obrisati resurs"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:977
msgid "An attempt to delete the specified resource <strong>%1</strong> failed."
msgstr "Pokušaj brisanja traženog resursa <strong>%1</strong> nije uspio."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:984
msgid "Unexpected Program Termination"
msgstr "Neočekivan prekid programa"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:985
msgid ""
"The program on your computer which provides access to the "
"<strong>%1</strong> protocol has unexpectedly terminated."
msgstr ""
"Program na vašem računaru koji pruža pristup protokolu "
"<strong>%1</strong> se neočekivano prekinuo."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:993
msgid "Out Of Memory"
msgstr "Nemam više memorije"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:994
msgid ""
"The program on your computer which provides access to the "
"<strong>%1</strong> protocol could not obtain the memory required to "
"continue."
msgstr ""
"Program na vašem računaru koji pruža pristup protokolu "
"<strong>%1</strong> nije mogao pristupiti memoriji koja je potrebna za "
"nastavak."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1002
msgid "Unknown Proxy Host"
msgstr "Nepoznat proxy računar"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1003
msgid ""
"While retrieving information about the specified proxy host, "
"<strong>%1</strong>, an Unknown Host error was encountered. An unknown host "
"error indicates that the requested name could not be located on the Internet."
msgstr ""
"Prilikom dobavljanja informacija o navedenom proxy računaru, "
"<strong>%1</strong>"
", došlo je do greške \"Nepoznat računar\". Ova greška znači da traženo "
"ime računara nije locirano na Internetu."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1007
msgid ""
"There may have been a problem with your network configuration, specifically "
"your proxy's hostname. If you have been accessing the Internet with no "
"problems recently, this is unlikely."
msgstr ""
"Možda postoji problem u vašoj mrežnoj konfiguraciji, konkretno u nazivu "
"vašeg proxy-ja. Ako ste nedavno pristupali Internetu bez ikakvih problema, "
"ovo je malo vjerovatno."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1011
msgid "Double-check your proxy settings and try again."
msgstr "Dva puta provjerite vaše proxy postavke i pokušajte ponovo."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1016
msgid "Authentication Failed: Method %1 Not Supported"
msgstr "Provjera autentičnosti nije uspjela: Metoda %1 nije podržana"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1018
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Although you may have supplied the correct authentication details, the "
"authentication failed because the method that the server is using is not "
"supported by the KDE program implementing the protocol %1."
msgstr ""
"Iako ste možda naveli tačne detalje za provjeru autentičnosti, ova "
"provjera nije uspjela zato što metodu koju koristi server ne podržava KDE "
"program koji implementira protokol %1."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1022
msgid ""
"Please file a bug at <a "
"href=\"http://bugs.kde.org/\">http://bugs.kde.org/</a> to inform the KDE "
"team of the unsupported authentication method."
msgstr ""
"Molim pošaljite bug na <a "
"href=\"http://bugs.kde.org/\">http://bugs.kde.org/</a> kako biste "
"informisali KDE team o nepodržanoj metodi provjere autentičnosti."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1028
msgid "Request Aborted"
msgstr "Zahtjev prekinut"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1035
msgid "Internal Error in Server"
msgstr "Interna greška na serveru"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1036
msgid ""
"The program on the server which provides access to the <strong>%1</strong> "
"protocol has reported an internal error: %0."
msgstr ""
"Program na serveru koji omogućuje pristup protokolu <strong>%1</strong> je "
"prijavio internu grešku: %0."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1039
msgid ""
"This is most likely to be caused by a bug in the server program. Please "
"consider submitting a full bug report as detailed below."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je najvjerovatnije izazvano bugom u serverskom programu. Molim "
"razmislite o prijavljivanju punog izvještaja o bugu kao što je objašnjeno "
"ispod."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1042
msgid "Contact the administrator of the server to advise them of the problem."
msgstr "Kontaktirajte administratora servera kako bi ga obavijestili o problemu."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1044
msgid ""
"If you know who the authors of the server software are, submit the bug "
"report directly to them."
msgstr "Ako znate ko su autori serverskog softvera, prijavite bug direktno njima."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1049
msgid "Timeout Error"
msgstr "Greška zbog isteka vremena"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1050
msgid ""
"Although contact was made with the server, a response was not received "
"within the amount of time allocated for the request as "
"follows:"
"<ul>"
"<li>Timeout for establishing a connection: %1 seconds</li>"
"<li>Timeout for receiving a response: %2 seconds</li>"
"<li>Timeout for accessing proxy servers: %3 seconds</li></ul>Please note "
"that you can alter these timeout settings in the KDE Control Center, by "
"selecting Network -> Preferences."
msgstr ""
"Iako je uspostavljena veza sa serverom, odgovor nije primljen u periodu "
"vremena koji je dodijeljen zahtjevu na ovaj način:"
"<ul>"
"<li>Vrijeme za uspostavljanje konekcije: %1 sekundi</li>"
"<li>Vrijeme za prijem odgovora: %2 sekundi</li>"
"<li>Vrijeme za pristup proxy serverima: %3 sekundi</li></ul> Obratite "
"pažnju da možete izmjeniti ova vremena u KDE Kontrolnom centru, birajući "
"Mreža -> Preference."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1061
msgid "The server was too busy responding to other requests to respond."
msgstr "Server je previše zauzet odgovarajući na druge zahtjeve da bi odgovorio."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1067
msgid "Unknown Error"
msgstr "Nepoznata greška"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1068
msgid ""
"The program on your computer which provides access to the "
"<strong>%1</strong> protocol has reported an unknown error: %2."
msgstr ""
"Program na vašem računaru koji omogućuje pristup protokolu "
"<strong>%1</strong> prijavio je nepoznatu grešku: %2."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1076
msgid "Unknown Interruption"
msgstr "Nepoznat prekid"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1077
msgid ""
"The program on your computer which provides access to the "
"<strong>%1</strong> protocol has reported an interruption of an unknown "
"type: %2."
msgstr ""
"Program na vašem računaru koji omogućuje pristup protokolu "
"<strong>%1</strong> prijavio je prekid nepoznatog porijekla: %2."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1085
msgid "Could Not Delete Original File"
msgstr "Ne mogu obrisati originalnu datoteku"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1086
msgid ""
"The requested operation required the deleting of the original file, most "
"likely at the end of a file move operation. The original file "
"<strong>%1</strong> could not be deleted."
msgstr ""
"Tražena operacija je zahtjevala brisanje originalne datoteke, vjerovatno "
"kao posljedicu operacije premještanja datoteke. Originalna datoteka "
"<strong>%1</strong> nije mogla biti obrisana."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1095
msgid "Could Not Delete Temporary File"
msgstr "Ne mogu obrisati privremenu datoteku"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1096
msgid ""
"The requested operation required the creation of a temporary file in which "
"to save the new file while being downloaded. This temporary file "
"<strong>%1</strong> could not be deleted."
msgstr ""
"Tražena operacija je zahtjevala pravljenje privremene datoteke u kojoj bi "
"bila spašena nova datoteka tokom downloada. Ova privremena datoteka "
"<strong>%1</strong> nije mogla biti obrisana."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1105
msgid "Could Not Rename Original File"
msgstr "Ne mogu promijeniti ime originalne datoteke"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1106
msgid ""
"The requested operation required the renaming of the original file "
"<strong>%1</strong>, however it could not be renamed."
msgstr ""
"Tražena operacija je zahtjevala promjenu imena originalne datoteke, "
"<strong>%1</strong>, ali njeno ime se nije moglo promjeniti."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1114
msgid "Could Not Rename Temporary File"
msgstr "Ne mogu promijeniti ime privremene datoteke"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1115
msgid ""
"The requested operation required the creation of a temporary file "
"<strong>%1</strong>, however it could not be renamed."
msgstr ""
"Tražena operacija je zahtjevala pravljenje privremene datoteke, "
"<strong>%1</strong>, ali njeno ime se nije moglo promjeniti."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1123
msgid "Could Not Create Link"
msgstr "Ne mogu napraviti link"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1124
msgid "Could Not Create Symbolic Link"
msgstr "Ne mogu napraviti simbolički link"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1125
msgid "The requested symbolic link %1 could not be created."
msgstr "Traženi simbolički link %1 nije mogao biti napravljen"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1132
msgid "No Content"
msgstr "Nema sadržaja"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1137
msgid "Disk Full"
msgstr "Disk pun"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1138
msgid ""
"The requested file <strong>%1</strong> could not be written to as there is "
"inadequate disk space."
msgstr ""
"Tražena datoteka <strong>%1</strong> nije mogla biti zapisana zbog "
"neadekvatnog diskovnog prostora na tom mjestu."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1140
msgid ""
"Free up enough disk space by 1) deleting unwanted and temporary files; 2) "
"archiving files to removable media storage such as CD-Recordable discs; or "
"3) obtain more storage capacity."
msgstr ""
"Oslobodite dovoljno disk prostora tako što ćete 1) pobrisati neželjene i "
"privremene datoteke, 2) arhivirati datoteke na izmjenjive medije za pohranu "
"kao što su CD-R diskovi ili 3) nabavite još smještajnog kapaciteta."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1147
msgid "Source and Destination Files Identical"
msgstr "Izvorna i odredišna datoteka su identične"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1148
msgid ""
"The operation could not be completed because the source and destination "
"files are the same file."
msgstr ""
"Operacija nije mogla biti završena budući da su izvorišna i odredišna "
"datoteka u stvari ista datoteka."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1150
msgid "Choose a different filename for the destination file."
msgstr "Izaberite neko drugo ime za odredišnu datoteku."

